  "instance_name": "holocaust_minimization_theme",
  "label": "Holocaust Minimization Theme",
  "description": "This refers to the tendency to downplay, trivialize, or distort the historical reality of the Holocaust, often by reducing its horror to a metaphor for other struggles. The meme’s text 'this project is tough but it will save the world' juxtaposed with the image of Holocaust victims is an example of this theme, as it attempts to equate extreme historical suffering with a modern motivational cliché, thereby minimizing the atrocity.",
